            blurb: >-
              # $[objectname]


              Name: Prismatic Radiance


              <br>


              </br>


              #### Crafting




              **Armour.**  Whenever a spell of 1st level or higher is cast within 5 feet of the wearer that is of a form of magic not currently stored within the armour, the caster must succeed on a DC 15 Constitution saving throw or the spell is negated and the form of magic is assimilated.  

              The armour gains beneficial effects depending on the assimilated magical energy:


              | Magic Form  | Effect |

              |:-----------:|:-------|

              | Arcane      | 

              | Nature      | 

              | Primordial  | 

              | Witchcraft | 

              | Vuurd       | 

              | Divine      | 


              All stored magic within the armour dissipates daily at Dusk.


              **Weapons.** Whenever a spell of 1st level or higher is cast within 5 feet of the wielder that is of a Form of Magic not currently stored within the weapon, the caster must succeed on a DC 15 Constitution saving throw or the spell is negated and the form of magic is assimilated.  

              The weapon gains beneficial effects depending on the assimilated magical energy:


              | Magic Form  | Effect |

              |:-----------:|:-------|

              | Arcane      | While wielding this weapon, you gain a +1 bonus to spell attack rolls for spells you cast.

              | Nature      | Creature's hit by this weapon cannot regain Hit Points until the end of your next turn.

              | Primordial  | Hits with this weapon deal an additional 1d6 damage of the same damage type as the spell assimilated.

              | Witchcraft  | Creature's hit by this weapon make Concentration saves at disadvantage until the end of your next turn.

              | Vuurd       | Whenever you hit a creature with this weapon, it's move speed is reduced by 5 feet until the end of your next turn.

              | Divine      | Creature's hit by this weapon cannot benefit from Invisibility or Hide from you until the end of your next turn.


              All stored magic within the weapon dissipates daily at Dusk.
