            name: Veilstalker Oil
            shared_name: 
            status: 1
            blurb: >-
              # $[objectname]


              *Rare Fauna Material*


              A slick, silvery secretion lining the inside of a Phase Spider's carapace. Faint blue-white light reflects unbidden in its oily surface.


              <pre>


              </pre>


              ### Harvesting


              **Harvest Duration.** 10 minutes (Medium or smaller), 20 minutes (Large), 30 minutes (Huge), 60 minutes (Gargantuan), 120 minutes (Colossal)


              **Harvest Penalty.** The creature must succeed on a DC 15 Constitution saving throw or be Poisoned for 1 hour. While poisoned in this manner, the creature cannot take Reactions and may take only an Action or Bonus action on their turn, not both, as they experience intermittent disorientation and difficult perceiving the flow of time accurately.


              <br>


              </br>


              ### Alchemy Properties


              **Unit Value:** 300ib


              **Base.** This Oil can serve as a Base for Alchemy, producing items of up to Rare quality.
