              Delicate strands that shimmering blue with otherworldly luminescence. Spun by Phase Spiders, this silk is infused with ethereal essence.


              <pre>


              </pre>


              ### Harvesting


              **Harvest Duration.** 5 minutes (Medium or smaller), 10 minutes (Large), 20 minutes (Huge), 30 minutes (Gargantuan), 60 minutes (Colossal)


              **Harvest Penalty.** N/A


              <br>


              </br>


              ### Crafting Properties


              **Unit Value:** 500ib


              **Clothing:** This item has a number of charges equal to the number of Units used in its creation (Maximum of 3).  

              While wearing clothing entirely made from Ethersilk, as a Bonus Action you can magically shift from the @[](byxwsptqfl) to @[](qeekjestlj). You expend one charge whenever you end your turn within @[](qeekjestlj). As a Bonus Action on your turn, or when you start your turn with no charges remaining, you return to the @[](byxwsptqfl).  

              This item regains all expended charges at Dusk during the Planar Tear.


              **Armour:** While wearing non-metallic armour stitched with Ethersilk, force damage that you take is reduced by 3 (minimum of 0).
